:: Whitney Pub Intervene Walk Home
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<set $bus to "orphanage">><<effects>>
The orphanage eventually comes into view, dark and quiet compared to the noises of the pub you left behind.
<br><br>
Whitney keeps a grip on you the whole way. Every now and then <<he>> glances back at you as if expecting you to bolt or watching to see if you dare try to defy <<him>> again.
The streetlights smear pale gold across the pavement as you move. The town feels too open after the cramped heat of the pub.
<br><br>
When you reach the door, Whitney finally stops. <<He>> doesn't let go right away.
"Don't get used to this. Landry can play bouncer all <<nnpc_he "Landry">> wants but I'm not letting some random perv put their hands on my property."
<br><br>
Whitney loiters on the doorstep, cigarette forgotten between <<his>> fingers. For a moment <<he>> looks like <<he>> might actually do something unexpected.
And <<he>> does.
<br><br>
<<He>> leans in to kiss your forehead.
<br><br>
Before you can even react, <<he>> pulls back, expression already hard again.
"Go sleep. Don't stay up too long." <<He>> lights the cigarette properly this time and takes a long drag from it. "See you around, babe."
<br><br>
You watch <<him>> skulk into an alley, leaving you alone.<<clotheson>>
